      en: ["Elevation: 1,000–1,800 m.", "Ceerigaabo population: ~50,000.", "Annual rainfall: ~600 mm.", "Average temperature: 20°C.", "Frankincense and myrrh production.", "Dominant soils: Leptosols, Cambisols."],
